&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Axon&#39;s Automation Technician L2, you will be responsible for repairing equipment, supporting manufacturing lines, performing preventive maintenance, quality testing, data gathering, filling out non-conformance reports, and supporting the engineering team and QA department as needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Onsite&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Automation Technician Supervisor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;None&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assemble, install, repair, and maintain automation components and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform preventative maintenance on production test equipment and subsystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback to Manufacturing Engineering, R&amp;amp;D, Training, and Quality teams, regarding failure modes and frequency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Directly support the manufacturing line to meet daily and monthly goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visually inspect, test, and assemble components or subassemblies using approved assembly procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a computer to perform testing, download information or record test data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use hand tools, machine tools and various types of equipment to repair and test products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote a continuous improvement environment by looking for more efficient ways to perform daily duties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively and work under pressure with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take initiative in a fast-paced, high-volume environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve problems or identify issues and assist in resolutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make reasonable decisions and escalate accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and comply with all ESD requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promotes a safe work environment by adhering to all safety requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-6 years of experience in electronics automation manufacturing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of electromechanical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret written instructions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use DMM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot electrical and mechanical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic computer skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work within a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and 401k with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave for all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional &amp;amp; Mental Wellness support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups (ERGs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And yes, we have snacks in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
