&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Axon CMM Metrology Programmer, you will perform dimensional and vision inspection and testing of incoming, in process, and finished product by using various measurement devices to ensure compliance with engineering specifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Onsite at Axon’s Pinnacle Manufacturing Location in Mesa, AZ&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: &lt;/strong&gt;Supervisor, Incoming Quality Control&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate the Axon OPTICAL/TACTILE CMM (Zeiss OIS-322/Calypso) to provide measurement analysis for incoming parts, in process and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program and Operate the Axon TACTILE CMM (Zeiss Contura/Calypso) to provide measurement analysis for incoming parts, in process and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Program and Operate the Axon Keyence LM system to provide measurement analysis for incoming parts, in process and finished goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain PiWeb and QC gage DB, structure and dimensional plans for future analysis and studies. Perform GR&amp;amp;R according to scheduled plan. Conduct FAIR and PPAP dimensional reports to evaluate new or modified parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide dimensional analysis for CAPA investigations to aid in root cause analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read and interpret CAD models and prints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate OPTICAL/TACTILE CMM programs to make repeat inspections more efficient. Manage the CMM equipment, including maintenance, calibration, and readiness of equipment. Assist in sustaining Critical to Quality processes via training and providing accept/reject samples to manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-4 year degree in Technology/Engineering or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 3 years Quality/Mfg experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of quality and lean manufacturing principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of quality systems, SPC and process capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong aptitude in process improvement and problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Programming skill with Calypso: PCM, freeform, curve, simulation and planner modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years OPTICAL and Tactile metrology experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum of 5 years working level experience measuring and programing CMM Zeiss Contura, CMM Zeiss OIS-322, Calypso Software and Keyence LM series.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and 401k with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave for all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional &amp;amp; Mental Wellness support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups (ERGs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And yes, we have snacks in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
