&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically &lt;strong&gt;5–7 years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in technical account management, customer success, implementation, solution engineering, or comparable customer-facing technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise software, SaaS platforms, cloud technologies, or integrated technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, analytical thinking, and root-cause analysis skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of networking, cloud infrastructure, enterprise integrations, and modern IT environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently manage complex customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communication and consulting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain and maintain CJIS compliance and satisfy customer background requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and 401(k) with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
