&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of RF coexistence, interference, desense, isolation, harmonics, spurious emissions, grounding, shielding, and EMI/EMC in compact multi-transceiver products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise integrating multiple transceivers into compact, highly integrated, battery-powered hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
