&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Firmware Design and Development of AIoT infrastructure for a variety of career-defining new programs that synthesize all Axon technologies in addition to current and next-gen Robotics, Camera-related products and their accessories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Firmware for eLinux or eAndroid-based System-on-Chips (SoC) and/or System-on-Modules (SoM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Firmware for Microcontrollers&lt;/li&gt;
