&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive inclusive hiring by proactively sourcing diverse talent and embedding equity throughout the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Juggle multiple high-priority searches without dropping the ball—or your standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
