&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;This position offers a hybrid work arrangement and &lt;strong&gt;requires regular travel to our Hardware Engineering Lab in Boston, MA&lt;/strong&gt;, with onsite presence based on project needs and development timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
