&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CAD, RMS, digital evidence, real-time operations, or integrated public safety ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams that build automations, integrations, operational workflows, internal tools, or AI-enabled solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience converting field-developed solutions into reusable frameworks, product improvements, or organizational playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technical talent development, competency frameworks, or academy-style enablement programs&lt;/li&gt;
