&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with prototyping tools and fabrication equipment (e.g., drills, bandsaws, 3D printers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of embedded systems, microcontrollers (e.g., ESP32, Arduino), and single-board computers (e.g., Raspberry Pi).&lt;/li&gt;
